But AI's existed for years.

00:01:17.699 --> 00:01:19.900
Why are all these discussions only popping up now?

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.500
Well, the long and short of it is that AIs entered a new phase of sophistication.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.599
What sparked a lot of this new conversation is what's known as generative AI,

00:01:27.599 --> 00:01:31.400
or computer programs that can create their own content based on prompts that it's been given.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.800
Let's say you want an image of a knight wearing red armor riding a blue horse through a battlefield.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:39.000
All you gotta do is type that into a program like Dall-E or Mid Journey,

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.000
