00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.900
Or let's try something even more complicated.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:47.599
Highly detailed coloring book pages of Foxy in a ruined pizzeria from Five Nights at Freddy's.

00:01:47.599 --> 00:01:49.000
And that's just talking about images.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.300
Pretty impressive, right?

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.900
Well, the controversy comes in when you realize how these generative AI work.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.800
They can't just create these new works out of nothing.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.000
They have to be fed other art, text, and music.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.900
And then they use information from those other works to create a quote-unquote new piece.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:06.699
This has led to a lot of discussion about whether or not what the AI's created is truly original work,

00:02:06.699 --> 00:02:09.600
